# OSRM map data (downloaded + prepared, ~100MB)
data/osrm/

# Local-only business notes (planning/competitive research) — never committed
local/

# Benchmark run reports (data/benchmarks/*_TIMESTAMP.md) are DAG run
# telemetry — MLflow is the system of record for every run (metrics,
# plots, per-bucket tables). Reports are NOT committed per run; when a
# milestone round cites a benchmark (champion switch, README number),
# it commits that specific report with `git add -f` as evidence.
# drift_baselines.json is state, not a run — it stays tracked.
data/benchmarks/*.md
